{"version":1,"key":"card:669","content":{"id":669,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8a894012-85ca-4698-b1ad-901875fb4b5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JWT 全称 JSON Web Token，是一种开放标准（RFC 7519），用以在各方通过 JSON 来安全地进行"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"身份验证"},{"type":"formatted","text":"和"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"信息交换"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b09eaa32-6925-4c30-9b55-217c77c30136","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b1142404-2c0c-4008-9cc4-d5a696fc35f7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbb07dde-112c-4d37-b9ee-b65395d28ea0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"身份验证：可以把 JWT 看作是门禁卡，在需要验证的地方，只要出示此门禁卡仅可，签名验证通过后，即可提取出携带的信息，而不用查询数据库，速度快"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ef349821-c8ce-4edb-a4ed-9ad025ff90aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e19deeee-28a1-4a02-9c03-f770947fe4e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息交换，在不可信的环境中，为防止被篡改，可以通过 JWT 交换信息，由于签名需要密钥，如果尝试对 JWT 进行篡改，由于没有私钥，生成的签名无法通过校验"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aa08f6de-420b-43fa-bc42-49ca2edf2e8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 HTTPS 环境下，为何还需要 JWT 来进行信息交换呢！HTTPS 可能并不是端对端的，可能在网关解密之后就使用 HTTP 进行通信，如果此时网关后有一台服务器被攻破，如果不使用 JWT，就可以随意篡改信息给下游，如果使用 JWT，那么就无法通过签名校验，下游会拒绝进行处理。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8cc2b28-da28-4e76-b31f-b513abdb79c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JWT 由三部分组成："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b3142e9b-a449-4a4a-8c04-82d4af3df27d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7c37112f-67b7-4350-b553-689cc1f78249","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"58095388-126d-4a55-accd-a6e0625576bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"头部（Header），包含两部分，令牌类型（JWT）和签名算法（如 HMAC SHA256 或 RSA）"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"14c50d05-24c6-4371-adfc-795a1ce8b8d6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f51263b4-a7d3-482e-9cd9-108a07c4299f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"alg\": \"HS256\",\n  \"type\": \"JWT\"\n}","collabId":"38612afe-fa1d-4ede-b5a7-fd13f6d7c44e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a601a0d8-0a64-46ab-97b4-b633e12ee986","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"504622dd-93bf-4d7f-ae00-679c277d6066","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"负载（Payload），携带的数据，通常包含实体数据和其他数据"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"fb97ed83-9d10-4ac9-ae2c-dcf2479cdb00","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"843aee31-8344-4372-9838-b829ef0713d5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"sub\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"admin\": true,\n  \"iat\": 1516239022\n}","collabId":"0057d277-3c8a-4332-ab7a-739812e6ff86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e1f19c5d-b665-44f6-857b-e70b45cee802","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8e09b87f-5b99-4cce-9ff3-b102a2ff39c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"签名（Signature），安全性所在，使用 Header 中声明的算法，使用持有的密钥以及前两部分的内容进行签名，算法如下"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{Signature=HMACSHA256(Base64Url(Header)+\".\"+Base64Url(Payload), Secret)}","collabId":"9de18818-17f3-4d76-808d-017fe6bbde4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"00ec89a2-adeb-4df6-898b-833f0b4061e2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f1ea2308-52ae-4aa5-9047-a62b94c8c9c4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import crypto = from crypto;\n\n// 1. 定义 Base64Url 转换函数 (核心：替换字符并去尾)\nconst base64UrlEncode = (str) => {\n    return Buffer.from(str)\n        .toString('base64')\n        .replace(/\\+/g, '-') // 把 + 替换为 -\n        .replace(/\\//g, '_') // 把 / 替换为 _\n        .replace(/=+$/, ''); // 去掉末尾的 =\n}\n\n// 2. 定义签名函数\nconst signJwt = (header, payload, secret) => {\n    // 第一步：编码 Header 和 Payload\n    const encodedHeader = base64UrlEncode(JSON.stringify(header));\n    const encodedPayload = base64UrlEncode(JSON.stringify(payload));\n\n    // 第二步：拼接\n    const content = `${encodedHeader}.${encodedPayload}`;\n\n    // 第三步：生成签名 (HMACSHA256)\n    const signature = crypto\n        .createHmac('sha256', secret)\n        .update(content)\n        .digest('base64') // 生成 base64\n        .replace(/\\+/g, '-') // 转换为 Base64Url 格式\n        .replace(/\\//g, '_')\n        .replace(/=+$/, '');\n\n    // 第四步：组合最终 Token\n    return `${content}.${signature}`;\n}","collabId":"fca7f256-1523-4af4-bcc0-1c0fc4ddfb83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e77dae8f-0070-4218-848c-305c8e72b55a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JWT 的特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a246f23b-e5a4-4de7-8d27-11ff54c04295","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"17e76314-f4c9-4902-bfb2-3c5f1e841ffa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f8f4443a-61fd-43d6-8f80-ff7eb003fb64","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无状态，只需通过计算验证签名，无需读取数据库，也就不需要在多服务器间进行同步，易于扩展"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8611f6b6-d563-430b-b064-f0c5b60c31ea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36f09c0d-e533-49ed-9bbe-17a45e124916","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"难以撤销，一旦颁发，在过期之前始终有效，除非有黑名单"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4b981292-9cf2-4902-b4bd-6c331ddbcad0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意事项："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9cd1b753-c465-4346-acfd-701e2f1251b3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2d22d895-fe7b-40f2-a661-adec1819ab73","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4b437e86-0df5-4a5e-beb4-c85852880033","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不放敏感数据： Payload 只是 Base64 编码，并非加密"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8c87121c-0c5a-45d6-8770-6ab1c21a4e4b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8199401b-89fd-418d-a724-48e94b00ff54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置过期时间： 为了安全，JWT 的有效期（exp）应该设置得短一些，并配合 Refresh Token 机制使用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3c50c040-e582-4f80-8638-7d5f4fa83a4f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe2ba606-085c-4f15-b25a-0aad0223a04c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HTTPS： 传输 JWT 时务必使用 HTTPS，防止 Token 被中间人劫持"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JWT","安全/签名"],"createTime":1768726648418,"updateTime":1768726823844,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1768726823844}}